2 CONT Ketevan (Georgian: ქეთევანი; 1764 – 5 July 1840) was a Georgian princess royal (batonishvili), a daughter of Heraclius II, the penultimate king of Kartli and Kakheti, and the wife of Ioann, Prince of Mukhrani. Like her sisters, Ma
2 CONC riam and Thecla, Ketevan was a poet of some talent and wrote in the spirit of early Romanticism.
