2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT “Romanoff HH Prince Alexander, in London on Saturday September 21st 2002 after a brief illness. Beloved husband of Maria Valguarnera Princess di Niscemi, great grandson of Emperor Alexander III, grandnephew of emperor Nicholas II,
2 CONC  grandson of HIH Granduchess Xenia and Granduke Alexander Mihailovitch, son of HH Prince Nikita and Princess Marie of Russia (nee Vorontsov-Dashkov). Funeral 11 am October 1st at The Russian Orthodox Cathedral of the Dormition, 67
2 CONC  Ennismore Gardens, London SW7. In lieu of flowers donations to Russian Orthodox Church in London at above address.” "Births, Marriages & Deaths." Times [London, England] 27 Sept. 2002: 35. The Times Digital Archive. Web. 27 Feb. 
2 CONC 2017.
